    <briefdescription>
<para>day counter class </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides methods for determining the length of a time period according to given market convention, both as a number of days and as a year fraction.</para><para>The Bridge pattern is used to provide the base behavior of the day counter. </para>    </detaileddescription>
